		<link rel="alternate" href="http://forums.postgresql.fr/viewtopic.php?pid=31268#p31268"/>
		<content type="html"><![CDATA[<p>Je pense que ce que vous voulez c&#039;est session_user, pas current_user: <a href="https://www.postgresql.org/docs/current/functions-info.html" rel="nofollow">https://www.postgresql.org/docs/current … -info.html</a></p>]]></content>
